At least 6 years in drug development including experiences of working in cross-functional matrix teams within a global R&D organization;
Knowledge of global drug development and registration with understanding of pharmaceutical portfolio risk management;
Working knowledge of China and/or Japan local practice, policy and regulation; and insight into what is required to be successful in the market also from commercial objectives;
Track records in delivering as part of a cross-functional project team;  

