Balances strategic thinking with execution excellence to drive change and deliver impact;
Fluent in written and spoken English and Japanese.

Qualification/Certificate

A scientific background with an advanced degree in relevant disciplines (e.g., medical, pharm, regulatory, quantitative sciences, business etc.);
MD/PhD/PharmD/MBA preferred.

